model c3_one_of_rule
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.3 G3 (#247, rulings 2 and 13): `one_of` is no form; written in a def's rule it is refused as any unknown word there is, by its place (one_of.tally holds it in a row). Written at C2, stored at the third pin."
source s "invented"
def dd: date
  rule base = one_of([2026-03-02, 2026-03-09])
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-01-01
ask a: dd
